  "order": 1,
  "title": "What did she say?",
  "goal": "Quote what people said with demek, and write the quote the Turkish way.",
  "points": ["gp-direct-speech"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "Put the quote first and *demek* after it: *“Geliyorum.” dedi*. In speech you can also start with *dedi ki*. And *demek* asks about meaning too: *Bu kelime ne demek?* (What does this word mean?)",
    "see": "gp-direct-speech"
  },
  "vocab": [
